OL,3,AKing Charles praises Welsh 'sense of
OL,4,Abelonging' as he opens Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has praised Welsh
OL,7,Fpeople's "sense of belonging", as he
OL,8,Fand Queen Camilla officially opened the
OL,9,FSenedd's seventh term.
OL,11,FThe visit marked the King's first
OL,12,Fofficial meeting with First Minister
OL,13,FRhun ap Iorwerth following the election
OL,14,Fvictory of Plaid Cymru - a party rooted
OL,15,Fin a strong republican tradition.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
