OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing Charles praises Welsh 'sense of
OL,4,Abelonging' as he opens Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his speech to the Senedd, with most
OL,7,Fof its 96 members in attendance
OL,8,Fincluding opposition parties Reform,
OL,9,FLabour and the Tories, the King also
OL,10,Fexpressed concern for the impact of
OL,11,Fclimate change on the Welsh
OL,12,Fcountryside.
OL,14,FAbout 30 protesters by the steps of the
OL,15,FSenedd were vocal throughout the royal
OL,16,Fvisit, and one was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of breaching the Public Order
OL,18,FAct.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
